 r←Test_YesOrNo_003(stopFlag batchFlag);myGuiParms;parms;msg;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise "YesOrNo" with default parms but a long question. Should return "Cancel".
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 myGuiParms←#._APLGUI.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 myGuiParms.testMode←1
 msg←'I have to make sure that you are really really certain about your decision?!'
 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.Dialogs.CreateParmsForYesOrNo
 parms.autoPress←#._APLGUI.GUI.Enums.Buttons.Cancel
 parms.timeout←0.1
 →PassesIf #._APLGUI.GUI.Enums.Buttons.Cancel≠parms myGuiParms #._APLGUI.GUI.Dialogs.YesOrNo msg

 r←∆OK
